              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, ithi: Ngenyanga yokuqala ngolokuqala lwenyanga uyakuthatha iduna elingenasici, uhlambulule indlu engcwele;",
          "type": "text",
