          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpristi kumelwe athathe elinye legazi lomnikelo wesono aligcobe ezinsikeni zomnyango wendlu nasemagumbini omane e-altare nasezinsikeni zomnyango wesango legceke elingaphakathi.",
          "type": "text",
