          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyakwenza kanjalo ngosuku lwesikhombisa lwenyanga kubo bonke abadukayo nabangenacala; ngakho-ke kufanele ubuyekeze indlu.",
