              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngenyanga yokuqala, ngosuku lweshumi nane lwenyanga, niyakuba nephasika, umkhosi wezinsuku eziyisikhombisa; isinkwa esingenamvubelo kumelwe kudliwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
